# Files an AI agent working in this repo should not read or modify.
#
# IMPORTANT - read this before relying on it:
# The mechanism Claude Code actually ENFORCES is the `permissions.deny`
# list in .claude/settings.json, which is checked on every tool call.
# This file is a companion declaration: it documents intent, is honoured
# by several other AI coding tools (Cursor, Continue, Cline), and keeps
# the sensitive-path list in one readable place. Treat settings.json as
# the enforcement point and this as the manifest - do not assume a tool
# respects this file without checking.

# ---- Secrets and credentials ----
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*credentials*
*secrets*
*.token

# ---- Live user data ----
# Real accounts, password hashes, chat history, credit balances.
app.db
app.db-shm
app.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
chat_data.json
credits.json
users.json

# ---- User-supplied and generated content ----
# Uploaded by whoever is using the app - not the developer's to read.
static/uploads/
static/generated/

# ---- Build output and dependencies ----
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
desktop/dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- Large binaries: noise, not source ----
brain/checkpoint-*.npz
brain/cpp/*.dll
*.safetensors
*.bin

# ---- Machine-local config ----
.claude/settings.local.json
